  "notes": "A beautiful coffee shop, a relaxed conversation and some background music — how quiet is “quiet” when we actually measure it?\nThis measurement captures a pleasantly calm café environment during a conversation. Music plays softly in the background, with a noticeable bass presence, while the coffee machine and occasional sounds from customers and the surrounding space create brief changes in level.\nAn interesting example of how a place can feel quiet and comfortable even when its soundscape is far from silent.",
